mands)\nNo changes needed, should work as-is:\n- `commit.md`, `pull_request.md`, `document.md`, `generate_branch_name.md`\n- `classify_issue.md`, `in_loop_review.md`, `patch.md`, `conditional_docs.md`\n- `implement.md`, `tools.md`\n\n**Total**: Remove 9, Adapt 7, Keep 9 commands"
